---
---

Boil @water{} in kettle and pour into #big pan{} at medium heat. Put #wooden spoon{} inside

In another #pot{}, add @sunflower oil{1 tbsp}, cubed @chicken breast{}, @garlic paste{1%tsp}, @ginger paste{1%tsp}, @salt{1%tsp}, @black pepper{1/2%tsp} and @chilli powder{1/2%tsp}

Mix and leave until chicken is cooked and cover with lid. Then empty @pasta sauce{1} jar and mix. Also add a bit of water (into the jar and onto the pot)														

Add @sweetcorn{5%tsp} to pot

Add @pasta{250%g} to boiled pan at medium heat. Add @salt{1%tsp}

Once cooked, drain pasta and add to pot, mix and sprinkle @italian seasoning{}